  "2026-09-26T16:57:51.543Z","harness:codex","Final gate with exact @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.26 and pm-changelog 2026.9.25: npm run release:check exit 0, 446 tests (444 passed, 2 pre-existing skips), 100/100/100/100 measured coverage, 0 production vulnerabilities, 0 clone pairs, 221/221 declarations documented, changelog/attestation/lifecycle gates pass. pm health --strict-exit --json ok=true with stale_in_progress_items:3 advisory. Canonical release and consumer publication remain pending PR review."
